    <h2>EV chargers in two-car garages</h2>
    <p>Fairview is where we install the most EV chargers. Most of these homes have 200-amp panels with room for a 48-amp circuit, and when a second electric car arrives, a load-sharing charger avoids a second big circuit.</p>
    <h2>Home offices and Wi-Fi that reaches</h2>
    <p>Large floor plans and finished basements leave Wi-Fi dead zones. We run network cable to home offices and mount access points on the ceiling, usually in a single day.</p>
    <h2>Finishing the basement</h2>
    <p>Finishing a basement needs a permit, AFCI-protected circuits and smoke alarms tied into the rest of the house. We wire it to pass the first time and coordinate with your contractor's schedule.</p>
